{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_title", "source_sha256": "557af6bda547c567bedef4a00c97239f141c43f41f33549e192774569d42c582", "ja": "ふたりで歩む道", "zh": "两人同行的道路", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "047a1e8e803f5c0e9926e24b8a881936c728c204882643b24e52622e8a9b4139", "ja": "海外のイベントに参加した雪歩と歩。\n出番直前、息がピッタリな事を再確認する\nアイドル達の一幕です。", "zh": "参加海外活动的雪步和步。\n这是偶像们在登台前，再次确认彼此默契十足的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2d7aeab7c9da8ffaa21192c71acba6327373ca2fc86ea94e1314d21c35464dc8", "ja": "（海外で開催される、日本文化をテーマにした\nイベントに、雪歩と歩が出演することになった！）", "zh": "（雪步和步要参加在海外举办的、以日本文化为主题的活动了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b617b586599098c750236decc6bd9cbfd894b8f2d8c34cbecdb60269d627e763", "ja": "{$P$}、お待たせ！\nアタシも雪歩も準備バッチリだよ！", "zh": "{$P$}，让你久等了！\n我和雪步都已经准备得妥妥的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f2cf34df5fc7d97bb5b10b81468f6ecdfd41722ec211dd724cf050ead5fa2bb5", "ja": "私たちの衣装、どうですかぁ？　ふたり揃うと、\nかなり決まってると思うんですけど……えへへ。", "zh": "我们的服装怎么样？两个人凑在一起，\n感觉挺搭的……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9d51855687c9132f22253f844593674315ae7c62bed75333a47dc2ae907c40b4", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだよ。\n並んで見ると、やっぱり壮観だな！", "zh": "啊，非常棒。\n并排一看，果然很壮观啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "18f6b10a6540486d9304659676ceb917768c10e3e8e98183e06375eaae994db2", "ja": "へへっ♪　バッチリなのは衣装だけじゃないよ、\n{$P$}！　ね、雪歩♪", "zh": "嘿嘿♪　完美的可不只是服装哦，{$P$}！对吧，雪步♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f794cee1047480fabe8e26efa6a96722ffa24179660fcb14dfe5874baee736d0", "ja": "そうなんです。私たち、すっごく息が合っちゃって……\nお互い、考えてる事がピッタリっていうか。", "zh": "是这样的。我们特别合拍……该说是彼此心里想的事情都一模一样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5f61174e1ae68c9ef12c326b022e79e732cd9a0760e89f59ce0d0ca457c74c2c", "ja": "さっきとかもさ、アタシが、なんか喉乾いたな～って\n思ってたら、雪歩がサッとドリンクくれてさ。", "zh": "刚才也是，我正想着“好像有点口渴了～”，雪步就马上给我递了饮料。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9c6c928a954b28462eaec5cfc094da9108f44e478b86d2f300f3de0ec236306f", "ja": "あれはたまたま、私も喉が渇いてたからで……。\nそれより歩ちゃんの方こそ。", "zh": "那只是碰巧，因为我当时也口渴了……比起那个，步才是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "05df207d140a90121e080f87298a6b0fbf57037b362c7fb6c910af74211a874a", "ja": "リハで私がつまづいたとき、すぐ支えてくれたよね？\nあれ、よくわかったなぁって……。", "zh": "排练时我绊了一下，你马上就扶住我了吧？\n我当时就在想，你居然能那么快察觉到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "450524a21014ec321423fd7131292a8387873a93a96ea7754743850b3ad79a1d", "ja": "ああ、なんか、雪歩の動きがわかったんだよな～。\nアタシたちってもしかして、超すごいかも？", "zh": "啊，总觉得一下就明白雪步的动作了呢～我们俩说不定超厉害？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2bd0ae77c503f991758cb43f428099b2a819f65d4ea81cd4e81c689c727fc139", "ja": "ふたりは今日のために、息を合わせてきたんだもんな。\n思った以上に、相性がよかったのかもしれない。", "zh": "你们两个人为了今天，一直在练习配合呢。\n说不定，你们比想象中还要合拍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "99e1a0beda96cdf0e630dba25327a972db0319a00bd5c7e63cdabd96da08b935", "ja": "えへへ♪　ちょっと照れちゃいますけど……。\nでも、嬉しいですぅ。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 虽然有点害羞……但是，我很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1fab6652a51c9649c40d6e5f6aeffb6d76b8f11a4312d819135cb94e4734e455", "ja": "よし、この調子で、本番もよろしく頼んだぞ！", "zh": "好，就保持这股势头，正式演出时也拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9c3140a62764380945edbea5e8d761a2ba83ac69d80d991db814b67be8b96ec3", "ja": "うん、任せて！　雪歩とふたりで\n最高のパフォーマンスをしてくるよ♪", "zh": "嗯，交给我吧！我会和雪步两个人带来最棒的演出♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "af6439d4db6e045c4c26d34e2ccb1e07c116cf4a2352214a23f04f710867f0a5", "ja": "っと……そろそろ開演か。", "zh": "呃……差不多要开演了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "40af50b6cf5cf3b8c17312d7bbc447632a2bf534ca1ba7a9b71fe6efd39fe816", "ja": "ん？　どうしたんだ、ふたりとも……。\nもしかして、プレッシャーを感じたとか？", "zh": "嗯？你们两个怎么了……\n难道是感到有压力了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3be7f9779545f94f977c12eac91606047aa4d3fdc830b7ff443a08ff7e422781", "ja": "あ、えっと。そういうのとはちょっと違うかも。\nうまく言えないんですけど……。", "zh": "啊，那个……可能和那不太一样。\n虽然有点说不清楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3141c5332c68d3a779ea86d53ce8bacb0cd5eb0e3c321b3f00c4beb0bc666a59", "ja": "お客さんの声を意識したら急に「しっかりやらなきゃ」\nって、気持ちに力が入っちゃって……。", "zh": "一想到客人的声音，就突然觉得“必须好好表现才行”，不知不觉就紧张起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bc81a3e90a0bf6bbbdbe0078331c0196127b5a95252b5316a8cb8a4fa1115bd6", "ja": "あ、それアタシもそう！　ちょっと\n肩に力入っちゃった気がするっていうかさ……。", "zh": "啊，我也是！总觉得肩膀好像有点绷紧了……或者说，是这么回事吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "78a7d6802a79adeec10732627ed9e00dcb0d5a85fd04b70108dac9f86d012f21", "ja": "なるほどな、うーん……？\nまあ、ふたりなら大丈夫だと思うよ。このまま行こう！", "zh": "原来如此，嗯……？\n不过，我觉得你们两个人的话应该没问题。就这样继续吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1023_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1f5884d8b61ab4d88223f9b9524aa459f833b6c614c13467cab3494b71ff6073", "ja": "えっ、{$P$}……？", "zh": "咦，{$P$}……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "511b8a92aa9034438b860ebe43230e65fe75239eeb103f4cd82202b008f83487", "ja": "だって、ふたりとも今、ほぼ同時だったから。\n本当に息がピッタリなんだなって実感できたよ。", "zh": "因为你们两个刚才几乎是同时开口的。  \n让我真切感受到，你们真的默契十足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "583fa3312ce8037939640983073f0506df2082f84cf099d44ea65594cea6d25b", "ja": "少しの緊張は、ステージのエッセンスだ。\n大丈夫、今のふたりなら、きっと乗り越えられるよ！", "zh": "稍微有点紧张，就当作是舞台的点缀吧。\n没事的，如果是现在的你们两个，一定能克服的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "439c7d87bc116deace9e135d2db38694e6adf544b413a9abf3540d59ab699d9c", "ja": "確かにそうだよね！　へへっ♪\nやっぱりいいこと言うね、{$P$}。", "zh": "确实是这样呢！嘿嘿♪\n果然说得好，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1027_004yuk", "source_sha256": "18fe75b36d61e7a5ce00994230567ddfe9130f2094afc3a2049bc7e60fcab097", "ja": "うん！　{$P$}が信じてくれるなら、\n私も信じられます。大丈夫だって……。", "zh": "嗯！只要{$P$}先生愿意相信我，\n我也就能相信。一定没问题的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1028_004yuk", "source_sha256": "eb212236aa459cfa8ee7aadf7df5458b99f7d5db1f0b83e6319938ab775586d0", "ja": "よろしくね、歩ちゃん！　一緒にいっぱい楽しもうね♪", "zh": "请多关照，步！一起好好享受吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "36faeac0870a6555aefa1217b10340e5ded687c335f950b563241307f6e155ac", "ja": "オッケー、雪歩！　アタシたちで、パーフェクトに\n盛り上げちゃおうよ！　レッツ・ジャパン☆", "zh": "好的，雪步！我们一起把气氛炒到最高潮吧！一起嗨翻日本☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_120_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_120_fc_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "15e85c16288e2111d9e2b59c54379251fb67538b6863e659f132dffa1e093f53", "ja": "（ふたりは足音を重ねて、舞台へと向かっていった。\nその足取りは確かで……これなら心配なさそうだな！）", "zh": "（两人踏着相同的脚步，走向舞台。\n步伐坚定……这样看来，应该不用担心了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
